# Component structure

1. Wrap every component that reads an observable in observer (rule component-structure-01)
2. Pass callbacks down, never the whole store (rule component-structure-02)
3. Keep one exported component per file and name the file after it (rule component-structure-03)
4. Derive display values with computed in the store, not in JSX (rule component-structure-04)
5. A view component reads state from its store and renders; it owns no business logic (rule component-structure-05)
